{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RAID: World War II is an action-packed four player cooperative shooter set in Europe during World War II, where your aim is to thwart the Nazi onslaught. Four prisoners of war \u2013 Sterling, Rivet, Kurgan and Wolfgang have been freed by \u201cMrs. White,\u201d a secret British Intelligence Operative, who needs someone to take down Hitler and his Third Reich once and for all. Their objective is to fight the war - without rules or mercy. Their reward is all the Nazi gold they can carry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/414740/extras/e5f141eaa05673a9e141ca7b2538f697.poster.avif?t=1755852381\" width=630 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/414740/extras/e5f141eaa05673a9e141ca7b2538f697.webm?t=1755852381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/414740/extras/e5f141eaa05673a9e141ca7b2538f697.mp4?t=1755852381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > THE RAID GANG - For glory, but mostly for money.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our four heroes are drawn from the main combatants in the European theater of World War II - Great Britain, USA, Germany and the Soviet Union. Each character has their own look with fully customizable uniforms making you stand out on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/414740/extras/05eee15fd627e172b4b77a19ca8ce790.poster.avif?t=1755852381\" width=630 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/414740/extras/05eee15fd627e172b4b77a19ca8ce790.webm?t=1755852381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/414740/extras/05eee15fd627e172b4b77a19ca8ce790.mp4?t=1755852381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CLASSES - Play it your way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from four different classes each with their own unique sets of playstyles and weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick off your enemies with precision as Recon, drown the Jerries in lead as Assault, soak up bullets as Insurgent, or blow everyone to smithereens as Demolitions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your Warcry- powerful abilities that buff you and your allies to help you turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/414740/extras/731ae5c1fe650fb71a96e288aa893663.poster.avif?t=1755852381\" width=630 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/414740/extras/731ae5c1fe650fb71a96e288aa893663.webm?t=1755852381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/414740/extras/731ae5c1fe650fb71a96e288aa893663.mp4?t=1755852381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >MISSIONS - Burn the enemy alive!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Raid places of historic importance across war-torn Europe. From the mighty Flakturm dominating the heart of Berlin, or the idyllic Bridge over the river Elbe, bring destruction to Nazis in every corner of Hitler\u2019s Reich.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find secret documents to unlock special Outlaw Raids, where you go behind your employers back and only focus on lifting as much gold for yourself as possible.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take on extended missions called Operations, a chained series of Raids set in familiar locations, featuring new storylines and objectives. The risks are greater, but so are the rewards!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHALLENGE CARDS - There\u2019s a twist</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn and use collectable Challenge Cards that let you spice up a mission in all kinds of ways. You may want a little health boost to get you across the finish line, tackle a mission with only pistols, or perhaps scuttle your way to victory using the fan \u201cfavorite\u201d Crab People.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"A Leap Of Faith","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/414740/67edee75798b1ac22d8bfa03182ec4b337866a0c.jpg"},{"name":"Ain't No Tower High Enough","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/414740/5ce1b6e311db8edb272ec61a8a55e1978bde754a.jpg"},{"name":"They'll Neven See It Coming","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/414740/a08df2bcbd12f7608eb5e6add1ec4242a01a26b1.jpg"},{"name":"Ninja RAID","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/414740/70f22f6cf809b77faf188354587f26f81269df24.jpg"},{"name":"The Shelter","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/414740/e92e1b0b972824c994bf6a06f17c9b688a03dc56.jpg"},{"name":"The Room Raider","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/414740/d05cc7e3fddd566a84bc7ade0a4c8d14297870bd.jpg"},{"name":"No Glory","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/414740/07eb90ae71de35f233b99d3e262f4f6d1ecef9e4.jpg"},{"name":"Premature Dynamite-ation","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/414740/0fe97326458d0513e57770e0ffb3ea4c2bfa04f0.jpg"},{"name":"Cranetastic","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/414740/21df88d5be800b974d9694f130feb61510aafd21.jpg"},{"name":"AA Anonymous","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/414740/2ad924552a4fb4b9b8a0b0b4dc340cb07ca59a45.jpg"}],"total":129},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/414740?t=1755852381","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/414740/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755852381","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/414740/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755852381","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/414740/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755852381","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Trading Cards","id":29},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h1>Special Edition</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/414740/extras/dd1449aa085256b5990936ff49cef7ce.avif?t=1755852381\" width=616 height=705 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >RAID: World War II Special Edition includes:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A special version of the in-game car Apple Red K\u00fcbelwagen.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The original soundtrack, complete with the \u201cmarching mace\u201d melee weapon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A special \u201cThe Admiral\u2019s Dagger\u201d melee weapon.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A decorative bomb for the camp.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exclusive special edition jackets for all four Raiders.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A RAID: World War II comic book available in-game and as a PDF.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Digital Art Book.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Four exclusive wallpapers.</p></li></ul></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >RAID: World War II is an action-packed four player cooperative shooter set in Europe during World War II, where your aim is to thwart the Nazi onslaught. Four prisoners of war \u2013 Sterling, Rivet, Kurgan and Wolfgang have been freed by \u201cMrs. White,\u201d a secret British Intelligence Operative, who needs someone to take down Hitler and his Third Reich once and for all. Their objective is to fight the war - without rules or mercy. Their reward is all the Nazi gold they can carry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/414740/extras/e5f141eaa05673a9e141ca7b2538f697.poster.avif?t=1755852381\" width=630 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/414740/extras/e5f141eaa05673a9e141ca7b2538f697.webm?t=1755852381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/414740/extras/e5f141eaa05673a9e141ca7b2538f697.mp4?t=1755852381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > THE RAID GANG - For glory, but mostly for money.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Our four heroes are drawn from the main combatants in the European theater of World War II - Great Britain, USA, Germany and the Soviet Union. Each character has their own look with fully customizable uniforms making you stand out on the battlefield.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/414740/extras/05eee15fd627e172b4b77a19ca8ce790.poster.avif?t=1755852381\" width=630 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/414740/extras/05eee15fd627e172b4b77a19ca8ce790.webm?t=1755852381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/414740/extras/05eee15fd627e172b4b77a19ca8ce790.mp4?t=1755852381\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CLASSES - Play it your way</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Choose from four different classes each with their own unique sets of playstyles and weapons.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pick off your enemies with precision as Recon, drown the Jerries in lead as Assault, soak up bullets as Insurgent, or blow everyone to smithereens as Demolitions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unleash your Warcry- powerful abilities that buff you and your allies to help you turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/414740/extras/731ae5c1fe650fb71a96e288aa893663.poster.avif?t=1755852381\" width=630 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/414740/extras/731ae5c1fe650fb71a96e288aa893663.webm?t=1755852381\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><sourc